<div class="form" style="max-width:900px">
    <h2 style="font-size:24px">Welcome</h2>
    <ol style="font-size:16px; line-height:2">
        <li>Export your PS4 save and decrypt it with your save tool.</li>
        <li>Click <b>Open a save</b> and pick <code>Customize_v002.sav</code> (or <code>System_v002.sav</code>).</li>
        <li>Change what you want on the pages that appear, then click <b>Save (download)</b>.</li>
        <li>Re-encrypt the downloaded save with your save tool and import it back to the PS4.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="note">
        Everything runs in your browser. Your save is never uploaded anywhere. Saving downloads the edited file with the same name;
        your original file is not changed, so it is your backup.
    </p>
    <p class="note">Customize_v002.sav is your character. System_v002.sav is your game settings.</p>
    <p class="warning">Warning: this is an online game. Using an edited save is against the publisher's rules and can get your account banned. Use it at your own risk.</p>
    <p class="accent" style="font-size:16px; font-weight:600">This editor is free. If someone sold it to you, or sold you an edited save, you were ripped off. @EditorState.Credit.</p>
</div>
